<title>USA: Omaha cattle steady/$0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle steady/$0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were steady-$0.50 lower. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Three shipments mostly Choice 2-4 1200-1250 lbs 66.00. Select and Choice 1100-1350 lbs 64.00-65.50. Select 61.00-64.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 950-1200 lbs 64.00-65.50, few at 66.00 off above steers. Select 61.00-63.50.</p>
</text>
